#: tutorials.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how to use both local and external &DCOP; calls to communicate with "
"external application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tutorials.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Slots"
msgstr "Pòrts"

#. Tag: para
#: tutorials.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how to use connections/slot to handle events. Both population and "
"standard slots are used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tutorials.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#. Tag: para
#: tutorials.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how to use @readSetting and @writeSetting functions to write/restore "
"widget content. Also, show how to use populate() slot to initialize widget "
"content."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tutorials.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Append"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tutorials.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how you can append text to TextEdit and how you can use it to display "
"formatted text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tutorials.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Line"
msgstr "Linha de comanda"

#. Tag: para
#: tutorials.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how you can pass parameters to &kommander; dialog via command line. "
"Also, shows how to change list content and button text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tutorials.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Initialize"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tutorials.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows how you use 'initialization' to 'destroy' scripts of main dialog to "
"initialize and store some settings."
msgstr ""
